Subject: grow native text append runs geometrically
Upstream-Status: Local optimization (not submitted)

Retain instantaneous NUL-terminated native text and existing AST owners.
Private parser/table run receipts retire before validation, input-line and
ownership changes; checked geometric growth avoids recopying each prefix.
Maintenance-only counters are absent from the production build and FFI.

